   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Medical Investments AB (GMI) was jointly established In 2009 by Elekta and Swedfund. The business concept is to &#x2013; together with local partners &#x2013; invest in, develop, and operate modern cancer clinics in developing countries. Currently GMI has opened clinics in Chile, the Dominican Republic, Ecuador and Ghana.</narrative>
